WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:01.467 line:0%
And finally,

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.169 line:0%
New Rule here
in the season of giving.

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:05.972 line:0%
Can we at least agree
that giving is good?

00:00:06.405 --> 00:00:07.707 line:0%
I bring this up because

00:00:07.773 --> 00:00:09.409 line:0%
one of the more
mind-blowing stories

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:12.846 line:0%
of this year was about
the internet celebrity, MrBeast,

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:15.248 line:0%
and how he was always
getting raked over the coals

00:00:15.314 --> 00:00:17.483 line:0%
for a series
of charitable endeavors.

00:00:17.816 --> 00:00:18.718 line:0%
Now, if you don't know,

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:21.688
MrBeast is the most
successful YouTuber ever

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:24.024
with over 38 billion views.

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:25.458
Feel old now?

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:28.127
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.929
Anyway, he takes
some of the money

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:32.499
made from 38 billion views,
and plows it back

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:33.766
into doing things like,

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.102
this year, partnering
with a group of doctors

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:39.639
to provide cataract surgery
for a 1,000 blind people,

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:41.207
that restored their eyesight.

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:45.011
-Cool, huh? Wrong!
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:47.212
He filmed
their overjoyed reactions,

00:00:47.279 --> 00:00:50.215
which to many made him
a performative altruist.

00:00:50.582 --> 00:00:52.585
A<i> Washington Post</i> reporter
tweeted...

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.259
And BuzzFeed agreed...

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.764
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:08.434
-(GUESTS LAUGHING)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:12.805
Okay, disability is something
that needs to be solved.

00:01:12.905 --> 00:01:13.973
(GUESTS CHUCKLE)

00:01:14.073 --> 00:01:16.976
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING,
CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:01:21.914 --> 00:01:24.850
And what truly needs curing
is blindness.

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:26.619
Here's how I know this.

00:01:27.586 --> 00:01:29.088
-♪ (UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING) ♪
-The newly sighted people

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:30.990
are cheering, not booing.

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:33.893
Because MrBeast,
whoever the fuck that is...

00:01:34.026 --> 00:01:36.829
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:36.895 --> 00:01:39.465
...just cured them
and you didn't do shit.

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:42.034
You know the expression,
"Shit or go blind"?

00:01:42.134 --> 00:01:43.135
You did neither.

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:46.706
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING,
CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.175
(SIGHS, CHUCKLES)

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:53.279
I tell ya,
I-- I don't get the woke.

00:01:53.413 --> 00:01:55.448
They love nothing more
than being a victim,

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:57.717
except when they really are one,
and then they tell you,

00:01:57.783 --> 00:02:01.187
-"I am not, go fuck yourself."
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:03.356
Get the-- Get this. Uh...

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:06.526
Last month, MrBeast,
in another dick move...

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:08.794
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:08.861 --> 00:02:10.996
...funded the construction
of a hundred wells

00:02:11.063 --> 00:02:14.833
across five countries in Africa
to provide clean drinking water

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.168
to half a million people.

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:19.972
-Good thing, right? No.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:20.172 --> 00:02:22.108
Not good, bad. (SCOFFS)

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:26.312
The founder of a charity
called Face Africa

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:29.048
called it...

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:39.325
Yes, but...
(CLICKS TONGUE, SIGHS)

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:40.994
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:44.030
But you know
what else is frustrating?

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:45.464
Dying of thirst.

00:02:45.531 --> 00:02:48.801
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING,
APPLAUDING, CHEERING)

00:02:49.736 --> 00:02:50.603
(BILL MAHER SCOFFS SOFTLY)

00:02:53.539 --> 00:02:57.343
"Man. MrBeast,
how dare he come in

00:02:57.409 --> 00:03:00.980
-and bogart digging the wells?"
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:04.216
"That's so White guy!
Always taking fresh water

00:03:04.283 --> 00:03:05.985
and shoving it
down our throats!"

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:07.353
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:11.056
Oh, another thing
this asshole did in Africa...

00:03:11.123 --> 00:03:14.960
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:19.298
...was pay for the rebuilding
of an African orphanage,

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:20.400
which the director

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.635
of the Hope and Homes
for Children charity

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:25.338
called it...

00:03:25.404 --> 00:03:27.039
-(CLICKS TONGUE)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:03:27.105 --> 00:03:28.141
So true.

00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:31.010
Ask any orphan to name
the worst part of their life.

00:03:31.077 --> 00:03:32.278
"Show-offs"!

00:03:32.345 --> 00:03:37.150
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, CHEERING,
APPLAUDING)

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:41.521
Please. Please.

00:03:41.621 --> 00:03:44.256
We should be celebrating
having dead parents.

00:03:44.323 --> 00:03:48.328
-Hey, it didn't hurt Batman.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:03:50.829 --> 00:03:54.266
(HESITATES) How did we get
to this weird place,

00:03:54.433 --> 00:03:57.136
telling people who are actually
out in the world

00:03:57.203 --> 00:04:00.039
making a positive difference,
"You're the problem"?

00:04:00.373 --> 00:04:03.008
Yeah, um, quick question.
Who the fuck are you?

00:04:03.075 --> 00:04:06.446
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)
-BILL: And--

00:04:10.116 --> 00:04:15.154
And this isn't only the media
and the people on Twitter

00:04:15.221 --> 00:04:18.891
who exist to bitch,
always finding something.

00:04:19.158 --> 00:04:21.894
"He just did it for the clicks,
or for the wrong reason!"

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.896
Or, "He should have done more,
or sooner, whatever.

00:04:23.963 --> 00:04:26.231
-You suck, signed X."
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:04:26.532 --> 00:04:31.104
-No. No, no.
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:04:34.173 --> 00:04:36.976
No, the--
This is... this is also

00:04:37.042 --> 00:04:40.146
the National Institutes
of Health, which last year,

00:04:40.212 --> 00:04:42.281
proposed to amend
their mission statement

00:04:42.348 --> 00:04:44.049
to exclude
the word "disability,"

00:04:44.116 --> 00:04:45.118
saying it, quote...

00:04:52.191 --> 00:04:56.228
-(INHALES, SIGHS HEAVILY)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:58.831
Let me take this moment
to go on record.

00:04:58.964 --> 00:05:01.433
Folks, if--
If I am ever struck blind

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:05.137
or deaf, or paralyzed,
don't praise me, fix me.

00:05:05.204 --> 00:05:07.907
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)
-Don't--

00:05:12.712 --> 00:05:15.915
Don't-- Don't sit around talking
about how much

00:05:15.982 --> 00:05:17.816
I'm just as good as you. Fix me!

00:05:18.016 --> 00:05:21.387
Do something.
Use AI. Invent something.

00:05:21.453 --> 00:05:23.889
Steal body parts
from a pet cemetery.

00:05:23.956 --> 00:05:27.493
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, CHEERING,
APPLAUDING)

00:05:27.927 --> 00:05:31.197
Steal stem cells from a frog.
Whatever it takes!

00:05:31.297 --> 00:05:33.466
Gene sequencing,
robotic eyeballs,

00:05:33.533 --> 00:05:34.666
harvesting clones.

00:05:34.733 --> 00:05:36.768
Inject me
with hamster platelets.

00:05:36.835 --> 00:05:39.505
Grow a new gallbladder
from impossible meat.

00:05:39.639 --> 00:05:41.240
Just do something!

00:05:41.307 --> 00:05:43.509
(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:45.511
(CHUCKLES)

00:05:48.647 --> 00:05:50.182
And if I catch on fire,

00:05:50.249 --> 00:05:51.817
you also have
my absolute permission

00:05:51.884 --> 00:05:53.118
to piss on my ass.

00:05:53.252 --> 00:05:56.089
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:05:58.424 --> 00:06:01.827
You know, there's so much faking
this time of year

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.796
between the presents
you don't wanna buy

00:06:03.863 --> 00:06:05.364
and the presents
you didn't wanna get,

00:06:05.431 --> 00:06:08.967
and the goodwill toward men
that lasts until January 2nd.

00:06:09.168 --> 00:06:11.704
-(INHALES)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:06:11.904 --> 00:06:15.608
I just don't have room for,
"And disability is awesome."

00:06:16.141 --> 00:06:17.243
It's not awesome.

00:06:17.309 --> 00:06:19.311
And it's not
a political affiliation.

00:06:19.411 --> 00:06:20.345
That's the problem.

00:06:20.546 --> 00:06:24.183
We turn everything into
a political identity category.

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:26.018
"You're deaf,
that's your identity.

00:06:26.151 --> 00:06:28.120
Don't mess up
a good thing by hearing."

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:31.891
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:06:32.625 --> 00:06:33.626
(SIGHS)

00:06:36.061 --> 00:06:41.500
When, uh, Adele lost weight,
she was excoriated for betrayal.

00:06:41.566 --> 00:06:44.670
To-- To who?
She betrayed the unhealthy?

00:06:44.737 --> 00:06:47.039
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:06:47.473 --> 00:06:49.508
The woke have even turned
the homeless

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:52.711
into a political identity group,
as opposed to liberals,

00:06:52.778 --> 00:06:53.879
old school liberals,

00:06:54.012 --> 00:06:56.215
who just want to get them
off the street,

00:06:56.415 --> 00:06:59.552
which now is seen
as kind of judgy, like...

00:06:59.685 --> 00:07:02.488
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:07:02.588 --> 00:07:05.090
...don't disturb them
in their natural habitat.

00:07:05.157 --> 00:07:08.728
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-(GUESTS CHUCKLE)

00:07:12.431 --> 00:07:13.932
They're... They're just...

00:07:14.299 --> 00:07:15.668
They're just living
their best life

00:07:15.768 --> 00:07:19.004
-under the bridge.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:07:19.605 --> 00:07:21.607
The woke think
the number one job

00:07:21.674 --> 00:07:24.076
is to protect homeless people
from stigma.

00:07:24.142 --> 00:07:27.213
I think the number one job
is to protect them from rain.

00:07:27.413 --> 00:07:30.549
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING,
CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:07:30.716 --> 00:07:31.918
(CLEARS THROAT)

00:07:34.319 --> 00:07:37.122
Speaking of which, when I did
the ice bucket challenge

00:07:37.189 --> 00:07:39.759
back in 2014, I thought
I was helping the cause

00:07:39.826 --> 00:07:43.396
of funding research
to cure ALS. Wrong again!

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:47.633 line:0%
An op-ed
in<i> Time Magazine</i> said...

00:07:54.239 --> 00:07:56.309 line:0%
It was suggesting no such thing.

00:07:56.375 --> 00:07:58.711 line:0%
What is wrong with this country
that so many people

00:07:58.778 --> 00:08:01.613
can't be happy for anything,
for even a second?

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:04.316
Ice bucket challenge?
America is more ready

00:08:04.383 --> 00:08:06.786
for the "Can you shit
on something good?" challenge,

00:08:06.952 --> 00:08:08.254
and yes, we're up to it.

